		{ String _name = "OrchardLodgeCherryTreeTip";		String _text = "Used to define an area to selectively cut down trees and plant new cherry trees seedlings. Size: 5x6. Cost: 32 logs, 12 stone. Radius: 24 tiles. Employment: 1-2 foresters. Tips: Ahoy, everything will be scuttled and replaced by a cherry tree which will spawn buckets of cherries over time. It be like an orchard but set up like a forester lodge."; }

